#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:14
msgid "sbt"
msgstr "sbt"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:17
msgid ""
"See [Basic Tasks](../guide/basic-tasks.md) in the Getting Started Guide for "
"an intro to the basics."
msgstr "有关基础介绍，请参阅入门指南中的[基本任务](../guide/basic-tasks.md)。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:19
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "概要"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:22
msgid ""
"`sbt`<br> `sbt` _command_ _args_<br> `sbt --server`<br> `sbt --script-"
"version`"
msgstr ""
"`sbt`<br> `sbt` _command_ _args_<br> `sbt --server`<br> `sbt --script-"
"version`"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:27
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:29
msgid ""
"sbt is a simple build tool created originally for Scala and Java. It lets us "
"declare subprojects and their various dependencies and custom tasks to "
"ensure that we'll always get a fast, repeatable build."
msgstr ""
"sbt 是最初为 Scala 和 Java 创建的简单构建工具。它让我们声明子项目及其各种依赖"
"和自定义任务，以确保始终获得快速、可重复的构建。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:31
msgid "sbt runner and sbt server"
msgstr "sbt runner 和 sbt server"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:33
msgid ""
"sbt runner is a system shell script named `sbt`, or `sbt.bat` on Windows. "
"That is capable of running _any version of sbt_. This is sometimes called "
"\"sbt-the-shell-script\"."
msgstr ""
"sbt runner 是名为 `sbt` 的系统 shell 脚本，Windows 上为 `sbt.bat`。它能够运行"
"_任意版本的 sbt_。有时也称为 \"sbt-the-shell-script\"。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:34
msgid ""
"When sbt 2.x is detected, sbt runner executes in a client mode, typically "
"using sbtn, a GraalVM native implementation of the thin client program."
msgstr ""
"当检测到 sbt 2.x 时，sbt runner 以客户端模式执行，通常使用 sbtn（瘦客户端程序"
"的 GraalVM 原生实现）。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:35
msgid ""
"sbt runner also executes sbt launcher, a launcher that is capable of running "
"_any verions of sbt_."
msgstr "sbt runner 还执行 sbt launcher，该启动器能够运行 _任意版本的 sbt_。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:36
msgid ""
"When you install sbt from a installer, what you're installing is the sbt "
"runner."
msgstr "当您从安装程序安装 sbt 时，您安装的是 sbt runner。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:37
msgid "sbt server is sbt's main artifact, and the actual build tool."
msgstr "sbt server 是 sbt 的主要构件，也是实际的构建工具。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:38
msgid ""
"The sbt version is determined by `project/build.properties` in each working "
"directory."
msgstr "sbt 版本由每个工作目录中的 `project/build.properties` 确定。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:39
msgid ""
"sbt server accepts commands from sbtn, network API, or via its own sbt shell."
msgstr "sbt server 接受来自 sbtn、网络 API 或通过其自身 sbt shell 的命令。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:45
msgid ""
"This mechanism allows builds to be configured to a specific version of sbt, "
"and everyone working on the project would use the same build semantics, "
"regardless of the sbt runner installed on their machine."
msgstr ""
"此机制允许将构建配置为特定版本的 sbt，项目中的每个人都会使用相同的构建语义，"
"无论其机器上安装的 sbt runner 是什么。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:47
msgid ""
"This also means that some features are implemented at sbt runner or sbtn "
"level, while other features are implemented at sbt server level."
msgstr ""
"这也意味着某些功能在 sbt runner 或 sbtn 级别实现，而其他功能在 sbt server 级"
"别实现。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:49
msgid "sbt commands"
msgstr "sbt 命令"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:52
msgid ""
"```admonish note title=\"Note on commands\"\n"
"In sbt, there are _tasks_ that operate at the subproject level (like "
"`compile`), and _commands_ in the narrow sense (like `set`), which is "
"capable of manipulating the build definition itself.\n"
"\n"
"Given that settings and tasks are lifted into the `act` command, we can "
"consider _all things that can be typed into the sbt shell_ as commands in "
"the wide sense.\n"
"See the [Command](../concepts/command.md) concept page for details.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish note title=\"关于命令的说明\"\n"
"在 sbt 中，有在子项目级别操作的**任务**（如 `compile`），以及狭义上的命令"
"（如 `set`），后者能够操作构建定义本身。\n"
"\n"
"鉴于设置和任务被提升到 `act` 命令中，我们可以将 _所有可输入 sbt shell 的内容"
"_ 视为广义上的命令。\n"
"详见[命令](../concepts/command.md) 概念页。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:68
msgid "Subproject-level tasks"
msgstr "子项目级任务"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:70
msgid "`clean` Deletes all generated files (the `target` directory)."
msgstr "`clean` 删除所有生成的文件（`target` 目录）。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:71
msgid ""
"[`publish`](./sbt-publish.md) Publishes artifacts (such as JARs) to the "
"repository defined by the `publishTo` setting."
msgstr ""
"[`publish`](./sbt-publish.md) 将构件（如 JAR）发布到由 `publishTo` 设置定义的"
"仓库。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:73
msgid ""
"[`publishLocal`](./sbt-publish.md) Publishes artifacts (such as JARs) to the "
"local Ivy repository as described in Publishing."
msgstr ""
"[`publishLocal`](./sbt-publish.md) 将构件（如 JAR）发布到本地 Ivy 仓库，如发"
"布章节所述。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:75
msgid ""
"[`update`](./sbt-update.md) Resolves and retrieves external dependencies."
msgstr "[`update`](./sbt-update.md) 解析并获取外部依赖。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:77
msgid "Configuration-level tasks"
msgstr "配置级任务"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:79
msgid ""
"Configuration-level tasks are tasks associated with a configuration. For "
"example, `compile`, which is equivalent to `Compile/compile`, compiles the "
"main source code (the `Compile` configuration). `Test/compile` compiles the "
"test source code (the `Test` configuration). Most tasks for the `Compile` "
"configuration have an equivalent in the `Test` configuration that can be run "
"using a `Test/` prefix."
msgstr ""
"配置级任务是与配置关联的任务。例如，`compile`（等价于 `Compile/compile`）编译"
"主源代码（`Compile` 配置）。`Test/compile` 编译测试源代码（`Test` 配置）。"
"`Compile` 配置的大多数任务在 `Test` 配置中都有等效项，可使用 `Test/` 前缀运"
"行。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:86
msgid ""
"[`compile`](./sbt-compile.md) Compiles the main sources (in the `src/main/"
"scala` directory). `Test/compile` compiles test sources (in the src/test/"
"scala/ directory)."
msgstr ""
"[`compile`](./sbt-compile.md) 编译主源代码（在 `src/main/scala` 目录中）。"
"`Test/compile` 编译测试源代码（在 src/test/scala/ 目录中）。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:89
msgid ""
"`console` Starts the Scala interpreter with a classpath including the "
"compiled sources, all JARs in the lib directory, and managed libraries. To "
"return to sbt, type :quit, Ctrl+D (Unix), or Ctrl+Z (Windows). Similarly, "
"Test/console starts the interpreter with the test classes and classpath."
msgstr ""
"`console` 使用包含编译源、lib 目录中所有 JAR 和托管库的 classpath 启动 Scala "
"解释器。返回 sbt 请输入 :quit、Ctrl+D（Unix）或 Ctrl+Z（Windows）。同样，"
"Test/console 使用测试类和 classpath 启动解释器。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:94
msgid ""
"`doc` Generates API documentation for Scala source files in `src/main/scala` "
"using scaladoc. `Test/doc` generates API documentation for source files in "
"`src/test/scala`."
msgstr ""
"`doc` 使用 scaladoc 为 `src/main/scala` 中的 Scala 源文件生成 API 文档。"
"`Test/doc` 为 `src/test/scala` 中的源文件生成 API 文档。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:97
msgid ""
"`package` Creates a JAR file containing the files in `src/main/resources` "
"and the classes compiled from `src/main/scala`. `Test/package` creates a JAR "
"containing the files in `src/test/resources` and the class compiled from "
"`src/test/scala`."
msgstr ""
"`package` 创建包含 `src/main/resources` 中文件和从 `src/main/scala` 编译的类"
"的 JAR 文件。`Test/package` 创建包含 `src/test/resources` 中文件和从 `src/"
"test/scala` 编译的类的 JAR。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:101
msgid ""
"`packageDoc` Creates a JAR file containing API documentation generated from "
"Scala source files in src/main/scala. Test/packageDoc creates a JAR "
"containing API documentation for test sources files in src/test/scala."
msgstr ""
"`packageDoc` 创建包含从 src/main/scala 中 Scala 源文件生成的 API 文档的 JAR "
"文件。Test/packageDoc 创建包含 src/test/scala 中测试源文件 API 文档的 JAR。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:105
msgid ""
"`packageSrc`: Creates a JAR file containing all main source files and "
"resources. The packaged paths are relative to src/main/scala and src/main/"
"resources. Similarly, Test/packageSrc operates on test source files and "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"`packageSrc`：创建包含所有主源文件和资源的 JAR 文件。打包路径相对于 src/main/"
"scala 和 src/main/resources。同样，Test/packageSrc 对测试源文件和资源进行操"
"作。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:109
msgid ""
"[`run <argument>*`](./sbt-run.md) Runs the main class for the project in the "
"same virtual machine as sbt. The main class is passed the arguments provided."
msgstr ""
"[`run <argument>*`](./sbt-run.md) 在与 sbt 相同的虚拟机中运行项目的主类。主类"
"接收提供的参数。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:112
msgid ""
"`runMain <main-class> <argument>*` Runs the specified main class for the "
"project in the same virtual machine as sbt. The main class is passed the "
"arguments provided."
msgstr ""
"`runMain <main-class> <argument>*` 在与 sbt 相同的虚拟机中运行项目指定的主"
"类。主类接收提供的参数。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:120
msgid ""
"[`test <test>*`](./sbt-test.md) Runs the tests specified as arguments (or "
"all tests if no arguments are given) that:"
msgstr ""
"[`test <test>*`](./sbt-test.md) 运行指定的测试（或未提供参数时运行所有测"
"试），包括："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:122
msgid "have not been run yet OR"
msgstr "尚未运行，或"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:123
msgid "failed the last time they were run OR"
msgstr "上次运行失败，或"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:124
msgid ""
"had any transitive dependencies recompiled since the last successful run<br> "
"`*` is interpreted as a wildcard in the test name."
msgstr ""
"自上次成功运行以来有任何传递依赖被重新编译<br> `*` 在测试名称中解释为通配符。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:127
msgid ""
"[`testFull`](./sbt-test.md) Runs all tests detected during test compilation."
msgstr "[`testFull`](./sbt-test.md) 运行测试编译期间检测到的所有测试。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:143
msgid "General commands"
msgstr "通用命令"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:145
msgid "`shutdown` Shuts down the sbt server to end the current sbt session."
msgstr "`shutdown` 关闭 sbt server 以结束当前 sbt 会话。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:146
msgid ""
"`exit` or `quit` End the current interactive session or build. Additionally, "
"Ctrl+D (Unix) or Ctrl+Z (Windows) will exit the interactive prompt."
msgstr ""
"`exit` 或 `quit` 结束当前交互式会话或构建。此外，Ctrl+D（Unix）或 Ctrl+Z"
"（Windows）将退出交互式提示符。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:149
msgid ""
"`help <command>` Displays detailed help for the specified command. If the "
"command does not exist, help lists detailed help for commands whose name or "
"description match the argument, which is interpreted as a regular "
"expression. If no command is provided, displays brief descriptions of the "
"main commands. Related commands are tasks and settings."
msgstr ""
"`help <command>` 显示指定命令的详细帮助。若命令不存在，help 会列出名称或描述"
"与参数（解释为正则表达式）匹配的命令的详细帮助。若未提供命令，则显示主要命令"
"的简要描述。相关命令包括任务和设置。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:155
msgid ""
"`projects [add|remove <URI>]` List all available projects if no arguments "
"provided or adds/removes the build at the provided URI."
msgstr ""
"`projects [add|remove <URI>]` 若无参数则列出所有可用项目，或添加/移除指定 "
"URI 的构建。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:166
msgid ""
"[Watch command](./watch.md) `~ <command>` Executes the project specified "
"action or method whenever source files change."
msgstr ""
"[Watch 命令](./watch.md) `~ <command>` 在源文件变更时执行项目指定的操作或方"
"法。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:168
msgid ""
"`< filename` Executes the commands in the given file. Each command should be "
"on its own line. Empty lines and lines beginning with '#' are ignored"
msgstr ""
"`< filename` 执行给定文件中的命令。每个命令应单独一行。空行和以 '#' 开头的行"
"将被忽略"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:171
msgid ""
"`A ; B` Execute A and if it succeeds, run B. Note that the leading semicolon "
"is required."
msgstr "`A ; B` 执行 A，若成功则运行 B。注意前导分号是必需的。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:173
msgid ""
"`eval <Scala-expression>` Evaluates the given Scala expression and returns "
"the result and inferred type. This can be used to set system properties, as "
"a calculator, to fork processes, etc ... For example:"
msgstr ""
"`eval <Scala-expression>` 计算给定的 Scala 表达式并返回结果和推断类型。可用于"
"设置系统属性、作为计算器、fork 进程等。例如："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:177
msgid ""
"    > eval System.setProperty(\"demo\", \"true\")\n"
"    > eval 1+1\n"
"    > eval \"ls -l\" !\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:194
msgid "Commands for managing the build definition"
msgstr "管理构建定义的命令"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:196
msgid ""
"`reload [plugins|return]` If no argument is specified, reloads the build, "
"recompiling any build or plugin definitions as necessary. reload plugins "
"changes the current project to the build definition project (in `project/`). "
"This can be useful to directly manipulate the build definition. For example, "
"running clean on the build definition project will force snapshots to be "
"updated and the build definition to be recompiled. reload return changes "
"back to the main project."
msgstr ""
"`reload [plugins|return]` 若未指定参数，则重新加载构建，必要时重新编译任何构"
"建或插件定义。reload plugins 将当前项目改为构建定义项目（在 `project/` 中）。"
"这可用于直接操作构建定义。例如，在构建定义项目上运行 clean 将强制更新快照并重"
"新编译构建定义。reload return 切换回主项目。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:203
msgid ""
"`set <setting-expression>` Evaluates and applies the given setting "
"definition. The setting applies until sbt is restarted, the build is "
"reloaded, or the setting is overridden by another set command or removed by "
"the session command."
msgstr ""
"`set <setting-expression>` 计算并应用给定的设置定义。该设置一直有效，直到 "
"sbt 重启、构建重新加载，或被另一个 set 命令覆盖或被 session 命令移除。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:209
msgid ""
"`session <command>` Manages session settings defined by the `set` command. "
"It can persist settings configured at the prompt."
msgstr ""
"`session <command>` 管理由 `set` 命令定义的会话设置。可持久化在提示符处配置的"
"设置。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:212
msgid ""
"`inspect <setting-key>` Displays information about settings, such as the "
"value, description, defining scope, dependencies, delegation chain, and "
"related settings."
msgstr ""
"`inspect <setting-key>` 显示有关设置的信息，如值、描述、定义作用域、依赖、委"
"托链和关联设置。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:217
msgid "sbt runner and launcher"
msgstr "sbt runner 和 launcher"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:220
msgid ""
"When launching the `sbt` runner from the system shell, various system "
"properties or JVM extra options can be specified to influence its behaviour."
msgstr ""
"从系统 shell 启动 `sbt` runner 时，可指定各种系统属性或 JVM 额外选项以影响其"
"行为。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:223
msgid "sbt JVM options and system properties"
msgstr "sbt JVM 选项和系统属性"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:225
msgid ""
"If the `JAVA_OPTS` and/or `SBT_OPTS` environment variables are defined when "
"`sbt` starts, their content is passed as command line arguments to the JVM "
"running sbt server."
msgstr ""
"若在 `sbt` 启动时定义了 `JAVA_OPTS` 和/或 `SBT_OPTS` 环境变量，其内容将作为命"
"令行参数传递给运行 sbt server 的 JVM。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:229
msgid ""
"If a file named `.jvmopts` exists in the  current directory, its content is "
"appended to `JAVA_OPTS` at sbt startup. Similarly, if `.sbtopts` and/or `/"
"etc/sbt/sbtopts` exist, their content is appended to `SBT_OPTS`. The default "
"value of `JAVA_OPTS` is `-Dfile.encoding=UTF8`."
msgstr ""
"若当前目录存在名为 `.jvmopts` 的文件，其内容在 sbt 启动时追加到 `JAVA_OPTS`。"
"同样，若存在 `.sbtopts` 和/或 `/etc/sbt/sbtopts`，其内容追加到 `SBT_OPTS`。"
"`JAVA_OPTS` 的默认值为 `-Dfile.encoding=UTF8`。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:234
msgid ""
"You can also specify JVM system properties and command line options directly "
"as `sbt` arguments: any `-Dkey=val` argument will be passed as-is to the "
"JVM, and any `-J-Xfoo` will be passed as `-Xfoo`."
msgstr ""
"您也可以直接以 `sbt` 参数形式指定 JVM 系统属性和命令行选项：任何 `-Dkey=val` "
"参数将原样传递给 JVM，任何 `-J-Xfoo` 将作为 `-Xfoo` 传递。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:238
msgid "See also `sbt --help` for more details."
msgstr "另请参阅 `sbt --help` 获取更多详情。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:241
msgid "sbt JVM heap, permgen, and stack sizes"
msgstr "sbt JVM 堆、permgen 和栈大小"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:243
msgid ""
"If you find yourself running out of permgen space or your workstation is low "
"on memory, adjust the JVM configuration as you would for any java "
"application."
msgstr ""
"若您发现 permgen 空间不足或工作站内存不足，请像对待任何 Java 应用一样调整 "
"JVM 配置。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:247
msgid "For example a common set of memory-related options is:"
msgstr "例如，常见的内存相关选项集为："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:250
msgid "\"-Xmx2048M -Xss2M\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:254
msgid "Or if you prefer to specify them just for this session:"
msgstr "或若您希望仅为此会话指定："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:260
msgid "Boot directory"
msgstr "启动目录"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:262
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`sbt` runner is just a bootstrap, the actual sbt server, Scala compiler and "
"standard library are by default downloaded to the shared directory  "
"`$HOME/.sbt/boot/`."
msgstr ""
"`sbt` runner 仅是引导程序，实际的 sbt server、Scala 编译器和标准库默认下载到"
"共享目录 `$HOME/.sbt/boot/`。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:266
msgid ""
"To change the location of this directory, set the `sbt.boot.directory` "
"system property. A relative path will be resolved against the current "
"working directory, which can be useful if you want to avoid sharing the boot "
"directory between projects. For example, the following uses the pre-0.11 "
"style of putting the boot directory in `project/boot/`:"
msgstr ""
"要更改此目录位置，请设置 `sbt.boot.directory` 系统属性。相对路径将相对于当前"
"工作目录解析，若您希望避免在项目间共享启动目录，这会很有用。例如，以下使用将"
"启动目录放在 `project/boot/` 的 0.11 之前风格："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:277
#, fuzzy
msgid "Global base directory"
msgstr "启动目录"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:279
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Global base directory contains machine-wide settings and plugins. This is "
"determined by:"
msgstr "包含全局设置和插件的目录。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:282
msgid "`-Dsbt.boot.directory` system property"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:283
msgid "`$SBT_CONFIG_HOME` environment variable."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:284
msgid "`%LOCALAPPDATA%/sbt` on Windows"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:285
msgid "`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/sbt` on non-Windows"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:286
msgid "`$HOME/.config/sbt`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:288
msgid "Then a subdirectory named `2`, for example, `$HOME/.config/sbt/2`."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:290
msgid "Terminal encoding"
msgstr "终端编码"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:292
msgid ""
"The character encoding used by your terminal may differ from Java's default "
"encoding for your platform. In this case, you will need to specify the "
"`file.encoding=<encoding>` system property, which might look like:"
msgstr ""
"您终端使用的字符编码可能与您平台上 Java 的默认编码不同。在这种情况下，您需要"
"指定`file.encoding=<encoding>` 系统属性，可能类似："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:297
msgid "\"-Dfile.encoding=Cp1252\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:301
msgid "HTTP/HTTPS/FTP Proxy"
msgstr "HTTP/HTTPS/FTP 代理"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:303
msgid ""
"On Unix, sbt will pick up any HTTP, HTTPS, or FTP proxy settings from the "
"standard `http_proxy`, `https_proxy`, and `ftp_proxy` environment variables. "
"If you are behind a proxy requiring authentication, you need to pass some "
"supplementary flags at sbt startup. See [JVM networking system properties]"
"(https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/doc-"
"files/net-properties.html) for more details."
msgstr ""
"在 Unix 上，sbt 会从标准环境变量 `http_proxy`、`https_proxy` 和 `ftp_proxy` "
"获取 HTTP、HTTPS 或 FTP 代理设置。若您在使用需要认证的代理后面，需在 sbt 启动"
"时传递一些补充标志。详见 [JVM networking system properties](https://"
"docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/doc-files/net-"
"properties.html)。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:309
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:315
msgid ""
"On Windows, your script should set properties for proxy host, port, and if "
"applicable, username and password. For example, for HTTP:"
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，您的脚本应设置代理主机、端口的属性，如适用还包括用户名和密码。"
"例如，对于 HTTP："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:322
msgid ""
"Replace `http` with `https` or `ftp` in the above command line to configure "
"HTTPS or FTP."
msgstr "将上述命令行中的 `http` 替换为 `https` 或 `ftp` 以配置 HTTPS 或 FTP。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:325
msgid "Other system properties"
msgstr "其他系统属性"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:327
msgid "The following system properties can also be passed to `sbt` runner:"
msgstr "以下系统属性也可传递给 `sbt` runner："

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:329
msgid "`-Dsbt.banner=true`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:331
msgid "Show a welcome banner advertising new features."
msgstr "显示宣传新功能的欢迎横幅。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:333
msgid "`-Dsbt.ci=true`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:335
msgid ""
"Default `false` (unless then env var `BUILD_NUMBER` is set). For continuous "
"integration environments. Suppress supershell and color."
msgstr ""
"默认为 `false`（除非设置了环境变量 `BUILD_NUMBER`）。用于持续集成环境。抑制 "
"supershell 和颜色。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:337
msgid "`-Dsbt.client=true`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:339
msgid "Run the sbt client."
msgstr "运行 sbt 客户端。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:341
msgid "`-Dsbt.color=auto`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:343
msgid "To turn on color, use `always` or `true`."
msgstr "要开启颜色，使用 `always` 或 `true`。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:344
msgid "To turn off color, use `never` or `false`."
msgstr "要关闭颜色，使用 `never` 或 `false`。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:345
msgid ""
"To use color if the output is a terminal (not a pipe) that supports color, "
"use `auto`."
msgstr "若输出是支持颜色的终端（非管道）则使用颜色，使用 `auto`。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:347
msgid "`-Dsbt.coursier.home=$HOME/.cache/coursier/v1`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:349
msgid ""
"Location of the Coursier artifact cache, where the default is defined by "
"[Coursier cache resolution logic](https://get-coursier.io/docs/"
"cache.html#default-location). You can verify the value with the command "
"`csrCacheDirectory`."
msgstr ""
"Coursier 构件缓存的位置，默认由 [Coursier cache resolution logic](https://"
"get-coursier.io/docs/cache.html#default-location) 定义。您可使用 "
"`csrCacheDirectory` 命令验证该值。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:351
msgid "`-Dsbt.genbuildprops=true`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:353
msgid ""
"Generate `build.properties` if missing. If unset, this defers to "
"`sbt.skip.version.write`."
msgstr ""
"若缺失则生成 `build.properties`。若未设置，则遵从 `sbt.skip.version.write`。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:355
msgid "`-Dsbt.override.build.repos=true`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:357
msgid ""
"If true, repositories configured in a build definition are ignored and the "
"repositories configured for the launcher are used instead."
msgstr "若为 true，则忽略构建定义中配置的仓库，改用为 launcher 配置的仓库。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:361
msgid "`-Dsbt.repository.config=$HOME/.sbt/repositories`"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt.md:363
msgid ""
"A file containing the repositories to use for the launcher. The format is "
"the same as a `[repositories]` section for a sbt launcher configuration "
"file. This setting is typically used in conjunction with setting "
"`sbt.override.build.repos` to `true`."
msgstr ""
"包含 launcher 使用的仓库的文件。格式与 sbt launcher 配置文件的 "
"`[repositories]` 部分相同。此设置通常与将 `sbt.override.build.repos` 设为 "
"`true` 配合使用。"
